{
  "id": "dmwaa3mjfqh0s",
  "name": "图片灯箱",
  "tags": [
    "弹窗",
    "遮罩"
  ],
  "summary": "点缩略图后，大图从缩略图的位置放大到居中（FLIP），带左右切换箭头、页码、下载与关闭按钮，Esc 也能关；遮罩是纯黑的。查看图片时把注意力完全交给图片本身，不打开新页面。",
  "usage": "相册、作品的图片预览，缩略图可点击时。图片 3–30 张用左右切换；桌面端为主，移动端需支持双指缩放。",
  "caution": "不要用它承载文字内容（那是弹窗的活）；超过 30 张要加缩略图条；纯黑遮罩在浅色页面里会突然出现，必须淡入过渡，不能硬切。",
  "hint": "点缩略图打开大图，左右箭头切换，Esc 或右上角关闭",
  "prompt": "【图片灯箱 Lightbox】目标：点缩略图后大图从缩略图位置放大到屏幕居中（FLIP），左右箭头切图、页码、下载/关闭按钮，Esc 关闭；遮罩纯黑。\n\n1) 结构：缩略图区（button.thumb × N）> 灯箱 .lightbox（position:fixed; inset:0; z-index 高；display:none → flex）+ .big 大图容器 + 左右 .nav 圆形箭头 + .topbar（页码 + 下载 + 关闭）。\n\n2) FLIP 放大：点缩略图后先把 .lightbox 设为 display:flex（让 .big 先落到目标位置），读 thumb 和 big 的 getBoundingClientRect，算出缩放比 s = thumbW/bigW 和平移 dx/dy（中心差），再用 el.animate：`[{transform:'translate(dx,dy) scale(s)',opacity:.45},{transform:'none',opacity:1}]`，300ms cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1)。关闭时反向，240ms ease-in，动画结束再隐藏灯箱。**不要用 CSS transition 做 FLIP**（Chromium 会把「设 transform + reflow + 改 transition」合并成瞬移）。\n\n3) 切图：页码 `.count` 更新为 `n / N`；大图做一个 opacity .35→1 的 180ms 淡入（或左右方向滑动），不要硬切。\n\n4) 交互：点缩略图打开；左右箭头切换（循环）；Esc 关闭、←/→ 切换；点遮罩空白处关闭（可选）；下载按钮触发下载。关闭后把滚动位置/焦点还给触发缩略图（focus 带 {preventScroll:true}）。\n\n5) 无障碍：灯箱 role=\"dialog\" + aria-modal；箭头和关闭按钮的图标**必须用 SVG**（←、→、X 都别用字符，× 也不行）；每个按钮有 aria-label。\n\n6) 坑：纯黑遮罩是图片查看的行业惯例，允许写死 #000（本 demo 用 color-mix 与透明混合）；FLIP 动画不要同时改 width/height（用 transform）；灯箱打开时 body 要锁滚动。\n\n7) 自动演示：只在 !window.__uiInteractive 时循环——光标点缩略图 → 打开 → 点右箭头 → 点关闭，一轮约 4 秒。弹窗里保留真实交互。\n\n8) 配色：缩略图和大图用渐变占位色块（var(--ui-brand)/success/warn 混合）；遮罩黑不跟随主题；文字白。\n\n9) 使用场景：相册、作品预览；数量多时加缩略图条，别只靠左右逐张翻。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{height:100%}\nbody{margin:0;overflow:hidden;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:16px}\n\n.thumbs{display:flex;gap:10px}\n.thumb{appearance:none;width:46px;height:46px;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden;cursor:pointer;\n  transition:transform .16s ease,box-shadow .18s ease}\n.thumb:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 6px 16px color-mix(in srgb,#000 22%,transparent)}\n.thumb.pressing{transform:scale(.94)}\n.ph{display:block;width:100%;height:100%}\n.p1{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--ui-brand),color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 45%,var(--ui-success)))}\n.p2{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--ui-success),color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-success) 45%,var(--ui-warn)))}\n.p3{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--ui-warn),color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-warn) 45%,var(--ui-danger)))}\n\n/* 灯箱：纯黑遮罩（这是图片查看器的行业惯例，prompt 里会说明） */\n.lightbox{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:60;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\n  background:color-mix(in srgb,#000 88%,transparent)}\n.big{width:min(230px,64vw);aspect-ratio:4/3;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;\n  box-shadow:0 20px 60px color-mix(in srgb,#000 50%,transparent);will-change:transform}\n\n.nav{position:absolute;top:50%;width:30px;height:30px;margin-top:-15px;border:0;border-radius:50%;\n  background:color-mix(in srgb,#fff 16%,transparent);color:#fff;cursor:pointer;\n  display:grid;place-items:center;padding:0;transition:background .15s ease,transform .12s ease}\n.nav:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,#fff 28%,transparent)}\n.nav.pressing{transform:scale(.9)}\n.nav.prev{left:10px}\n.nav.next{right:10px}\n.nav svg{width:14px;height:14px;display:block;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}\n\n.topbar{position:absolute;top:10px;left:10px;right:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:#fff}\n.count{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;letter-spacing:.04em}\n.tools{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:6px}\n.tool{width:26px;height:26px;border:0;border-radius:7px;background:color-mix(in srgb,#fff 14%,transparent);\n  color:#fff;cursor:pointer;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:0;\n  transition:background .15s ease,transform .12s ease}\n.tool:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,#fff 26%,transparent)}\n.tool.pressing{transform:scale(.9)}\n.tool svg{width:13px;height:13px;display:block;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  body{padding:10px}\n  .thumbs{gap:8px}\n  .thumb{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:8px}\n  .big{width:min(190px,60vw)}\n  .nav{width:26px;height:26px;margin-top:-13px}\n  .nav.prev{left:7px}\n  .nav.next{right:7px}\n  .topbar{top:8px;left:8px;right:8px}\n  .count{font-size:9.5px}\n  .tool{width:23px;height:23px;border-radius:6px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .thumb,.nav,.tool{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"thumbs\">\n  <button class=\"thumb\" data-i=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看第 1 张图片\"><span class=\"ph p1\"></span></button>\n  <button class=\"thumb\" data-i=\"1\" aria-label=\"查看第 2 张图片\"><span class=\"ph p2\"></span></button>\n  <button class=\"thumb\" data-i=\"2\" aria-label=\"查看第 3 张图片\"><span class=\"ph p3\"></span></button>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"lightbox\" id=\"lb\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"图片查看\">\n  <div class=\"topbar\">\n    <span class=\"count\" id=\"count\">1 / 3</span>\n    <div class=\"tools\">\n      <button class=\"tool\" id=\"dl\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"下载\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 4v10\"/><path d=\"M8 11l4 4 4-4\"/><path d=\"M5 19h14\"/></svg>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"tool\" id=\"close\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"关闭\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\"/></svg>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <button class=\"nav prev\" id=\"prev\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"上一张\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14.5 5.5 8 12l6.5 6.5\"/></svg>\n  </button>\n  <div class=\"big\" id=\"big\"><span class=\"ph p1\" id=\"bigPh\"></span></div>\n  <button class=\"nav next\" id=\"next\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"下一张\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.5 5.5 16 12l-6.5 6.5\"/></svg>\n  </button>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var lb=document.getElementById('lb'),\n      big=document.getElementById('big'),\n      bigPh=document.getElementById('bigPh'),\n      count=document.getElementById('count'),\n      thumbs=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.thumb')),\n      closeBtn=document.getElementById('close'),\n      prevBtn=document.getElementById('prev'),\n      nextBtn=document.getElementById('next'),\n      dlBtn=document.getElementById('dl');\n  var idx=0, isOpen=false, cursor=null, timers=[];\n\n  function later(fn,ms){ var id=setTimeout(fn,ms); timers.push(id); return id; }\n\n  function paint(){\n    var cls='ph p'+(idx+1);\n    bigPh.className=cls;\n    count.textContent=(idx+1)+' / '+thumbs.length;\n  }\n\n  /* 打开：从缩略图位置 FLIP 放大到居中（记录 rect → el.animate，不靠 CSS 过渡） */\n  function open(i,fromThumb){\n    idx=i; isOpen=true;\n    paint();\n    lb.style.display='flex';\n    lb.style.opacity='';\n    if(fromThumb&&fromThumb.getBoundingClientRect){\n      var tr=fromThumb.getBoundingClientRect(), br=big.getBoundingClientRect();\n      if(tr.width&&br.width){\n        var s=tr.width/br.width;\n        var dx=(tr.left+tr.width/2)-(br.left+br.width/2);\n        var dy=(tr.top+tr.height/2)-(br.top+br.height/2);\n        big.animate([\n          {transform:'translate('+dx+'px,'+dy+'px) scale('+s+')',opacity:.45},\n          {transform:'none',opacity:1}\n        ],{duration:300,easing:'cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1)'});\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  /* 关闭：反向缩回缩略图，遮罩淡出后隐藏 */\n  function close(){\n    if(!isOpen) return;\n    isOpen=false;\n    var t=thumbs[idx];\n    var tr=t.getBoundingClientRect(), br=big.getBoundingClientRect();\n    if(tr.width&&br.width){\n      var s=tr.width/br.width;\n      var dx=(tr.left+tr.width/2)-(br.left+br.width/2);\n      var dy=(tr.top+tr.height/2)-(br.top+br.height/2);\n      var a=big.animate([\n        {transform:'none',opacity:1},\n        {transform:'translate('+dx+'px,'+dy+'px) scale('+s+')',opacity:.4}\n      ],{duration:240,easing:'ease-in',fill:'forwards'});\n      a.onfinish=function(){ a.cancel(); big.style.transform=''; };\n    }\n    var lbA=lb.animate([{opacity:1},{opacity:0}],{duration:240,easing:'ease-in',fill:'forwards'});\n    lbA.onfinish=function(){\n      lb.style.display='none';\n      lbA.cancel();\n      lb.style.opacity='';\n    };\n  }\n\n  function step(d){\n    idx=(idx+d+thumbs.length)%thumbs.length;\n    paint();\n    big.animate([{opacity:.35},{opacity:1}],{duration:180,easing:'ease-out'});\n  }\n\n  thumbs.forEach(function(t){\n    t.addEventListener('click',function(){ open(Number(t.getAttribute('data-i')),t); });\n  });\n  closeBtn.addEventListener('click',close);\n  prevBtn.addEventListener('click',function(){ step(-1); });\n  nextBtn.addEventListener('click',function(){ step(1); });\n  dlBtn.addEventListener('click',function(){});\n  document.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){\n    if(!isOpen) return;\n    if(e.key==='Escape') close();\n    else if(e.key==='ArrowRight') step(1);\n    else if(e.key==='ArrowLeft') step(-1);\n  });\n\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursor) return cursor;\n    if(window.__uiInteractive) return null;\n    if(typeof window.__uiDemoCursor==='function') cursor=window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    return cursor;\n  }\n\n  function press(el,after){\n    var c=ensureCursor();\n    if(!c) return;\n    c.moveTo(el);\n    later(function(){\n      c.press(); el.classList.add('pressing');\n      later(function(){\n        c.release(); el.classList.remove('pressing');\n        after();\n      },190);\n    },560);\n  }\n\n  /* 自动演示：点缩略图打开 → 点右箭头切一张 → 点关闭缩回 */\n  function demo(){\n    var c=ensureCursor();\n    if(!c) return;\n    var r=thumbs[0].getBoundingClientRect();\n    if(!r.width||!r.height){ later(demo,300); return; }\n    c.el.classList.add('show');\n    press(thumbs[0],function(){\n      open(0,thumbs[0]);\n      later(function(){\n        press(nextBtn,function(){\n          step(1);\n          later(function(){\n            press(closeBtn,function(){\n              close();\n              c.hide();\n              later(demo,900);\n            });\n          },1200);\n        });\n      },1000);\n    });\n  }\n\n  if(!window.__uiInteractive){\n    later(function(){\n      if(thumbs[0].getBoundingClientRect().width) demo();\n      else later(demo,300);\n    },300);\n  }\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>",
